Operators set the single optional top-level `license` helm value (a base64url licence payload produced by the `wire-licensing` CLI); it is rendered into galley's `settings.license` and background-worker's `license` config keys. The `WIRE_LICENSE` environment variable is no longer read. Unset, the meeting join-by-link endpoints return `403 id-feature-error`.
Licence payloads follow the 2026-10-08 RFC: `license_content` with `entitlements`, and `schema_version` 1 is the only accepted version.
